The suite's measured cold ratios were 1.000182 [0.997784, 1.002585] at K0/F2^37, 0.991425 [0.989017, 0.993839] at K1/F2^47, and 0.990408 [0.988664, 0.992154] at K0/F2^57. Values below one mean greater candidate cost in this cohort. The native suite analysis did not meet the preregistered lower-bound threshold above 1.01. Partial holdout ratios are plotted separately and remain provisional until every frozen pair is present.

The runner stopped twice on `cand/icv1-f2m57-tm747311035-c1f545af/M43-T177/r5.price.json` after 60 busy-machine refusals per attempt. The first stop was around 16:44 UTC; the same-host resume was started at 18:47 UTC and stopped at 19:13 UTC. Unrelated Git, EFS and research jobs used more CPU than the unchanged preflight's 0.20 CPU-second per two-second limit; another benchmark held the global lock during part of the wait. None of these attempts was admitted as a timed price record. The retained tree has 282 refusal lines. The incomplete schedule must be resumed only on this instance with the same binaries, CPU reservation and isolation guard after sustained quiet.

Independent native `ic_validate certverify` passed for the current host's 1,010 retained price records and 2,020 IC/rho scalar certificates. The former host's separate A/A tree was recovered read-only from snapshot `snap-0ac0539f266bbe1a6`: 220 scheduled records, 39 retries, 90 pin records and zero missing A/A cold pairs. Its K0/F2^57 ratio was 0.998332 [0.993237, 1.003453]. Its 349 records and 698 certificates also passed independent checks. Former-host timings are kept separate and do not fill current-host holdout pairs.

*Remaining gates:* complete the frozen holdouts; apply the prespecified interval-width extension rule; independently replay selected recorded runs and recompute all headline figures from committed raw data; attach a matched same-process rho reference and the 0/0.1/1 GAE band; render the final validated result and open a regular PR. The local release library test had 4,840 passes and nine inherited/environment failures, while the touched Koblitz filter passed 177 tests; the integration suite had one unchanged R07 analysis mismatch. These broad gates are not described as green.

The full descriptive Markdown report and paths to raw custody are in `REPORT.md` beside this PDF. No observation from this Intel CPU subclass is automatically a result for the Emerald Rapids Table A host class.

